<title>HONG KONG: Kwoon Chung declares 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Kwoon Chung declares 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   30.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.7</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.13 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    63.21</p>
<p>    Turnover		     261.76</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kwoon Chung Bus Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 14-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   about October</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong-based bus line operator Kwoon Chung was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on September 25, 1996.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents interest income on share application monies received in respect of the issuance of new shares of the company in September 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
